{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫台慶劇《璀璨之城》即將進入結局周，劇中爭鬥愈來愈激烈，昨晚（30日）播出一集中有不少震撼鏡頭，劇中奸到出汁的張智霖（Chilam）先是大力掌摑陳瀅，再向將對方拖入廁所執行「水刑」，雖然鏡頭前Chilam「攞你命三千」，但實質為了保護陳瀅</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:11.906354+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T10:11:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.064371+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.064371+00:00","content_hash":"2506ce883453404d9d43fc9160b21c1c129c3c1b1a69cd1d54a4ef856421f16b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}